  "title": "THE HOLONOMY BRAIDING FORUξ(sl2) IN TERMS OF GEOMETRIC QUANTUM DILOGARITHMS",
  "authors_raw": "CALVIN MCPHAIL-SNYDER AND NICOLAI RESHETIKHIN",
  "abstract": "We derive an explicit formula for the holonomyR-matrix of quantumsl2 at a root of unity. We show it factorizes into a product of four quantum dilogarithms and satisfies a holonomy Yang-Baxter equation. This factorization extends previously known results and we collect many existing results needed for our computation.",
  "docinfo": {
   "Author": "Calvin McPhail-Snyder; Nicolai Reshetikhin",
   "Creator": "arXiv GenPDF (tex2pdf:a6404ea)",
   "Producer": "pikepdf 8.15.1",
   "Title": "The holonomy braiding for $\\mathcal{U}_\\xi(\\mathfrak{sl}_2)$ in terms of geometric quantum dilogarithms"
  },
